ensation depends on the distance of your flight between airports:</p><ul><li>In case of a flight up to 1500 km – 250 Euro</li><li>In case of flights between 1500 – 3500 km – 400 Euro</li><li>In case of flights over 3500 km – 600 Euro</li></ul><p>Delay at the final destination should be more than 3 hours.</p>"}}]]}]]}]]}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$15"}}]]}]
